                "text": "Molly, a social worker at a cancer treatment center in Shreveport, often sees patients who lose their employer-based insurance because they\u2019re too sick to work. #Medicaid helps patients like hers, and countless other Louisianians, get the care they need. We won\u2019t stop fighting to protect it. @ACSCAN",
