                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "In light of President Biden\u2019s cancer diagnosis, my heart is with him. He is a true statesman, patriot, and worldwide respected icon. I\u2019ll never forget the personal kindness he showed to me and my family. It\u2019s been an honor to serve under his leadership. He and his family are in our prayers.\n\n\u2014TAC",
