                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I\u2019m saddened to hear of President Biden\u2019s cancer diagnosis. He has devoted his life to serving the American people, and now is the time for him to focus on healing. He, Dr. Jill Biden, and their family are in my prayers as he faces this battle. I\u2019m confident in his strength and resilience, and I wish him a full and speedy recovery.",
